func=jag::game::StatTable::UpdateStat	func_addr=0x001b6950	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::game::StatTable::UpdateStat - UPDATE_STAT ServerProt handler. handler+0x8 \e jag::Client*.\nWire: g4_alt1 experience (LE), g1_add currentLevel (+0x80), g1_inv statId (-b).\nStat entry: client[0x198e0]->[0x7618] \e StatTable; entries at table+0x10, stride 0x18;\n  +0x0 infoPtr, +0x8 isRatioStat flag, +0xc experience, +0x10 realLevel, +0x14 currentLevel.\nDirty ring: client[0x19958], int[64] at +0xc8 indexed by (counter++ & 0x3f) at +0xd0.\nEvidence: (1) byte-identical packet decode + transforms vs Linux jag::game::StatTable::UpdateStat;\n(2) calls FUN_00366fa0, the outlined level-recompute whose 200000000/2000000000 caps match the\nLinux inline exactly; (3) referenced only from DATA (prot handler table @00b5db58) as a handler must be.
