func=jag::game::SendOpObjStack	func_addr=0x000e4810	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::game::SendOpObjStack — Windows counterpart of Linux 0x137b50. Builds the OPOBJ1..6 payload.\nModern branch (g_protocolRevision >\e 0x3b5): [0] flags \e writeByteSubtract(runBit | menuOpen<<1); [1..3] objId 3-byte BE medium; [4..5] worldY BE; [6..7] worldX BE.\nrunBit  \e (*(client+0x198e0 MAINLOGIC_MANAGER) + 0x4f0) >> 2 & 1   (Linux reads the same field at +0x490)\nmenuOpen\e *(char*)(*(client+0x198e8 MINIMENU) + 0x68)              (Linux reads [MINIMENU]+0x68 identically)\nProves OMiniMenu.MENU_OPEN \e 0x68 on Windows (identical to Linux) — read at 0x000e4a73 / 0x000e48bc.
