func=jag::game::RebuildSceneEntry::Reset	func_addr=0x00405690	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=Engine const BUILD_AREA_INIT. Initialises a 0x68-byte RebuildSceneEntry: stores sceneKey at +0, zeroes +8..+0x60, then reserves 4 vectors: srcKeys/destKeys/levels (4-byte elements, reserve 20 -> 0x50 bytes) and the matrix rows (0x18-byte elements, reserve 20 -> 0x1e0 bytes). Entries are inserted into the build-area/WorldList vector at client+0x19810 (stride 0x68).
